Subject: [PATCH 1/4] =?UTF-8?q?fix(chat):=20C8/C9=20=E2=80=94=20take=20ide?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ntity=20and=20plan=20only=20from=20the=20session,=20expire=20su?=
 =?UTF-8?q?bscriptions,=20unify=20model=20catalog?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- chat: userId/userEmail/userPlan from the request body are no longer read (a client could send
  userPlan:"ultra" or a VIP email and get Ultra for free); identity is resolved by the pure
  resolveChatIdentity() from session + stores; no session => 401 in production
- chat/conversations: the shared demo-user fallback exists only outside production
  (config.allowAnonymousChat); conversations are looked up strictly per owner
- feedback/analytics is admin-only; admin key compared in constant time (safeEqualStrings)
- billing: subscriptions now expire (resolveBillingPlan + grace period applied in the auth
  middleware); Stripe customer.subscription.updated extends renewsAt for auto-renewals
- models: /api/meta and chat resolve models from the single registry, so a selected model no
  longer silently turns into "auto"; claude-3-haiku and deepseek-v4.1-flash require Plus
- gateway: template/mock answers and simulated failures are impossible in production
- web: stop sending userId/userEmail/userPlan

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012JQZ5kjDAEncyyErFsiwm8
